# DIAGNOSTICS

cpu exits with `cpu:` <node>`:` and why it couldn't start: the dial's error, `connection closed` when the other node doesn't answer the handshake (its key isn't <key>, or it doesn't pin this node's), `no key from factotum` where this namespace has no `proto=noise-ik` grant, or `the node ended the session before it began` when it took the call but never attached this namespace (its log says why).

